T:Auld Lang Syne
C:Trad. Words by Burns.
O:Scotland
Z:Paul Hardy's Songs Tunebook 2025 (see www.pghardy.net). Creative Commons CC BY-NC-SA licenced.
M:4/4
L:1/8
