w:John* An-der-son, my jo, John, wh-en we were first ac-quent,
(ED)|B,2 E2 E2 F2|G4 G2 A2|B3 A G2 A2|B6|
w:Your* locks were like the ra-ven, your bon-ny brow was brent;
(dc)|B3 A G2 B2|d4 c2 B2|A3 G F2 G2|A6|
